    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legend says Newton dreamed of apples... A lot!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419790/extras/a8105caf091beb62ecf34eab419b267c.poster.avif?t=1741295002\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419790/extras/a8105caf091beb62ecf34eab419b267c.apng?t=1741295002\" class=\"bb_img\" width=180 height=180 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Newton</strong> is a solo 2D <i>pixel art</i>\u00a0arcade-<strong><i>platformer</i></strong> game made with Unreal Engine 5. Collect apples, master gravity and set high score in this simple but challenging adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Unique Powers</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invert gravity.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the teleportation apple.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport instantly to the next spot! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419790/extras/91dfb9dc210b4108369c38827ea23239.poster.avif?t=1741295002\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419790/extras/91dfb9dc210b4108369c38827ea23239.webm?t=1741295002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419790/extras/91dfb9dc210b4108369c38827ea23239.mp4?t=1741295002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Best Challenger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and <strong>improve</strong> locally, beat the high scores, and become the top player on the online leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419790/extras/7740408d642c926431a1f80362425468.avif?t=1741295002\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock the Codex</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the good, the bad, and the quirky apples:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the hidden apples.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn each apple\u2019s unique properties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your personal counter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master all their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419790/extras/0651f342b887b4e2b03e0badf685be49.avif?t=1741295002\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legend says Newton dreamed of apples... A lot!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419790/extras/a8105caf091beb62ecf34eab419b267c.poster.avif?t=1741295002\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419790/extras/a8105caf091beb62ecf34eab419b267c.apng?t=1741295002\" class=\"bb_img\" width=180 height=180 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Newton</strong> is a solo 2D <i>pixel art</i>\u00a0arcade-<strong><i>platformer</i></strong> game made with Unreal Engine 5. Collect apples, master gravity and set high score in this simple but challenging adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Unique Powers</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invert gravity.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the teleportation apple.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport instantly to the next spot! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419790/extras/91dfb9dc210b4108369c38827ea23239.poster.avif?t=1741295002\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419790/extras/91dfb9dc210b4108369c38827ea23239.webm?t=1741295002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419790/extras/91dfb9dc210b4108369c38827ea23239.mp4?t=1741295002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Best Challenger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and <strong>improve</strong> locally, beat the high scores, and become the top player on the online leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419790/extras/7740408d642c926431a1f80362425468.avif?t=1741295002\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock the Codex</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the good, the bad, and the quirky apples:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the hidden apples.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn each apple\u2019s unique properties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your personal counter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master all their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419790/extras/0651f342b887b4e2b03e0badf685be49.avif?t=1741295002\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
